Cell["\<\
The spray at the centre of a grid, drawn by the geodesics through each edge, \
and the spray itself cut at depth 3.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"03134480-26c1-4e2e-b8fb-6eecf3cc926d"],

