 "The geodesics from ",
 StyleBox["c", "TI"],
 " to ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 " are the paths of the spray from ",
 StyleBox["c", "TI"],
 " to ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 "; the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["GeodesicIntervalGraph"]], 
